    "group": "Venom",
    "summary": "As [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, if no models are aboard this **TRANSPORT**, you can pick a **DRUKHARI INFANTRY** unit of yours with at most 6 models, that cannot **FLY**, and that sits wholly within 6\" of the Venom. Unless that unit is in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of any enemy unit, it can [embark](vsdata:core-rule/embarking) in this **TRANSPORT**, even in a turn in which it has [disembarked](vsdata:core-rule/disembarking) from a **TRANSPORT**.",
